  "narrative": "Recalculation workbook for loan LN-DEMO-2001 as of 2026-07-15 (USD), built under config loan-calc-cfg-2026.07 against approved rate table rt-2026.06. The two interest accruals recompute to 500.00 on a 30/360 basis and 246.58 on an actual/365 basis; the servicing ledger shows 500.00 and 250.00, a -3.42 immaterial variance on the July accrual. The flat late fee ties out at 35.00; the 0.25% servicing fee recomputes to 250.00 against a booked 200.00, a material 50.00 variance flagged for human review. The 12-month level-payment schedule amortizes 12,000.00 at a 1,066.19 scheduled payment to a zero ending balance. The payoff figure walks principal, accrued interest, and open fees net of unapplied funds to 100,031.58. Participation interest of 1,000.00 allocates pro-rata across the lead and two participants and sums exactly to the shared total. Recomputed interest, fee, and payoff totals reconcile to the approved calculation engine with no out-of-balance items. These figures are analytical recomputations for human review only; the material servicing-fee variance is routed to human servicing-exception handling, and any account change requires separate human authorization. Illustrative loan-servicing recalculation for analytical review only; not a posting, adjustment, waiver, reversal, or approval, and not financial, legal, or tax advice. Every figure is conditional on the cited agreement terms, servicing data, and approved rate tables, and a qualified human must review and separately authorize any account change."
